OL,5,Amayor Mamdani says
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least eight people have been killed
OL,8,Fafter a three-story building collapsed
OL,9,Fon Wednesday in Brooklyn, says New
OL,10,FYork's mayor
OL,12,FIn a statement, Zohran Mamdani says 17
OL,13,Fmore, including three firefighters,
OL,14,Fhave been injured - read his update in
OL,15,Ffull
OL,17,FRescue efforts are ongoing, with dozens
OL,18,Fof emergency workers seen scouring the
OL,19,Fwreckage for survivors
